  "name": "dawn-patrol",
  "vibe": "5:45am on an empty road. #16324f predawn blue, a coral (#ff7955) sun that physically climbs as the scene advances, and hi-vis #ffe14d for anything that matters. Big Shoulders Display runs tall, condensed and uppercase on every beat. The world sweeps a 90px-wide pale road arc across the lower frame with seven yellow lane dashes streaming along it, plants 5K / 4K / 3K distance posts down the right, and animates a pale stick runner whose arms and legs swing on a 6Hz cadence while the whole body bobs. Statement beats go full coral; the CTA goes full hi-vis yellow with an ink block button — the loudest frame in this batch. Titles and items both streak in, and the camera adds a hard 0.34 lateral slide at multiplier 7. Owns a gauge Ring, feed Scroll, check Toggles and roll Morphs. For run clubs, gyms, races and sportswear.",
